      "id": "claim_1b4b778ce7b94dfa888aa85b8863a28a",
      "statement": "Crypto is a stateless static helper class wrapping the JCE (javax.crypto and java.security) for all cryptographic primitives; it holds no keys or state of its own, and callers supply keys either as javax.crypto.SecretKey objects or raw byte arrays.",
